# Etali, Primal Conqueror's dig finds Lightning Bolt on top of Bot2's library and We Say Thee Nay! on top of Bot1's,
# and Bot2 casts both for nothing as the trigger resolves: the Bolt at Bot1, then the counterspell, whose only legal
# target is that Bolt.
#
# We Say Thee Nay! is the point. Its target is chosen after its optional cost, teamwork, is announced (CR 601.2b-c),
# so a cast made as an effect resolves must not aim it beforehand the way it aims a Lightning Bolt. It did: the cast
# then refused the target it had just been handed, after the answer was already taken, and the game was left with
# nobody asked anything. Here the cast asks in the order a cast from hand does — teamwork or not, then the target —
# and the game goes on.
#
# Bot2 says no to teamwork, so the ransom is {2}, which Bot2 pays for its own Bolt out of the Forest and the Mox it
# kept back. The Bolt resolves: 20 - 3 = 17. The counterspell is Bot1's card and goes to Bot1's graveyard, on top of
# the Island Bot1 discarded to hand size on turn three.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island x8
We Say Thee Nay!
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Guerrilla Gorilla
Mountain
Etali, Primal Conqueror
Mox Emerald
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Guerrilla Gorilla.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Etali, Primal Conqueror.Cast
Bot2.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot2.Target(Bot1)
Bot2.Choose(We Say Thee Nay!)
Bot2.Modes(Cast without teamwork)
Bot2.Target(Stack.Lightning Bolt)
? Stack = We Say Thee Nay!; Lightning Bolt
? Exile.Count = 0
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.PayCost
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Step = Main2
Stack.Count = 0
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 17
Bot1.Graveyard = We Say Thee Nay!; Island
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus; Black Lotus; Black Lotus
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Guerrilla Gorilla; Mox Emerald; Mountain; Etali, Primal Conqueror
Bot2.Battlefield.Guerrilla Gorilla.Tapped = false
